            405  *
            406  *      DEVICE TABLE:-
            407  *
            408  *  1,  IF THE ENTRY IS 0 THEN THE DEVICE IS NOT PRESENT.
            409  *  2,  IF THE LS BIT OF THE ENTRY IS A '0' THEN
            410  *           THE ENTRY IS THE ADDRESS OF THE TRANSFER
            411  *           VECTOR FOR THE SERVICE ROUTINE.
            412  *  3,  IF THE LS BIT OF THE ENTRY IS A '1' THEN
            413  *           THE DEVICE IS A 9902, BITS 1-14 FORM THE
            414  *           R12 CONTENTS FOR THE SERVICE ROUTINE AND
            415  *           A CR DELAY WILL BE ADDED IF THE MSB IS A '1'
            416  *
0084 0000   417  DEVTBL DATA VDPDSR            1-VDP
